  seam_voicebank_cli run-generation-batch BATCH_JSON BATCH_SHA256 [MAX_TOTAL_FRAMES]
  seam_voicebank_cli import-generated-batch WORKSPACE BATCH_JSON BATCH_SHA256 OPERATOR UTC [MAX_TOTAL_FRAMES]
  seam_voicebank_cli prepare-generation WORKSPACE PROJECT TRACK_ID REGION_ID TAKE_ID JOB_ID JOB_DIRECTORY
  seam_voicebank_cli prepare-generation-batch OUTPUT_JSON JOB_REFERENCE [JOB_REFERENCE ...]
    Bakes unapproved candidates using saved recipe references; does not assign or approve takes.
  seam_voicebank_cli import-procedural WORKSPACE METADATA WAV RECIPE TAKE PROMPT COVERAGE MIDI OPERATOR UTC [SUPERSEDES]
  seam_voicebank_cli import-generated WORKSPACE METADATA WAV RECIPE EXPECTATION SHA256 OPERATOR UTC
    Collects generated output only against its retained expectation; never refreshes a stale request.
    Imports into an existing procedural producer workspace as unapproved MarkerReview material.
  seam_voicebank_cli inspect-source-quality WORKSPACE STRATEGY
  seam_voicebank_cli register-source WORKSPACE PROJECT_SHA256 ID human|procedural|tts pass|blocked|not-assessed SOURCE_USE TRANSFORM REDISTRIBUTE COMMERCIAL LICENSE LICENSE_SHA256 PRODUCER UTC
    Each permission is yes|no. Appends/selects a NEW source; records your declaration, not legal or musical verification.
  seam_voicebank_cli record-source-quality WORKSPACE STRATEGY PROJECT_SHA256 ID REVIEWER UTC COVERAGE LISTENING EVIDENCE EVIDENCE_SHA256
    Outcomes: pass|blocked|not-assessed. Records an independent supplied decision; never grants source rights or unit approval.
  seam_voicebank_cli init-production WORKSPACE DRAFT_DEFINITION FILE_SHA256 PRODUCER UTC
    Creates a new empty Draft from a captured schema-2 definition, without musical approval.
  seam_voicebank_cli create-sample-draft WORKSPACE BANK_ID VERSION NAME ja|en|ko STYLE OUTPUT_DIRECTORY
    Copies current takes into a new editable manifest with UNREVIEWED marker/pitch estimates; never approves.
  seam_voicebank_cli prepare-sample-review WORKSPACE MANIFEST OUTPUT_PACKET
  seam_voicebank_cli inspect-sample-review PACKET FILE_SHA256
  seam_voicebank_cli review-sample WORKSPACE PACKET FILE_SHA256 REVIEWER UTC accept|reject [UNIT ...]
  seam_voicebank_cli publish-sample WORKSPACE MANIFEST EXPECTED_GENERATION PROJECT_SHA256 OUTPUT_DIRECTORY
    Capture/inspect never approves. Review requires a registered independent reviewer and explicit decision.
    Publication is an engineering candidate, not a signed package, install, or release approval.
